Iridium craft-i18n
===================

This repository holds the interface translations shared by the Iridium apps
(Sheets, CAD, Docs, PDF, Decks).

It began as the upstream craft-i18n project and keeps its MIT and Apache-2.0
licences. The upstream copyright and attribution are unchanged in LICENSE-MIT
and LICENSE-APACHE, and the third-party credits are unchanged in
ATTRIBUTION.md.

What changed here:

  * The per-app catalogs are named after the app id each one belongs to, so
    `locales/<locale>/iridium_pdf.tsv` is read by the PDF app, and so on.
  * The upstream product names in the translations are replaced with ours.

The translations themselves are the upstream translators' work and are
attributed in ATTRIBUTION.md.
